title: Engine Sound Enhancement (ESE) / Fake Engine Sound Disable
raw_community_title: 'Remove fake engine noise (STILL IN PROGRESS)


  NOTE: If you have the Technology package with 14 speaker B&O system, use code 2
  in the ACM, and Leave DSP as code D'
category: Audio and Entertainment
platform: Explorer
model_years: 2025-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2025-2026 Explorer.xlsx
notes: If first digit is 1, change to 0, this  will turn off ANC (active noise cancellation).
  use 2 to keep ANC enabled.
steps:
- module: ACM
  address: 727-01-01
  mask: xxxx xxxx *xxx
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 8
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Third Row Speaker Left Output  (TRSLO)
      target_state: TRSLO Main Speaker Only
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Third Row Speaker Left Output  (TRSLO)
      target_state: TRSLO Main Speaker Only
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Third Row Speaker Left Output  (TRSLO)
      target_state: TRSLO Main Speaker Only
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: Third Row Speaker Left Output  (TRSLO)
      target_state: TRSLO Main Speaker Only
    recommended_hex: '0'
- module: DSP
  address: 783-01-01
  mask: '*xxx xxxx xx'
  notes: Change 1st digit to C. Note:if your AS BUILT Is a D, leave it selected to
    keep ANC enabled.
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 0
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: ANC/Propulsion Sound (ANCPS)
      target_state: ANCPS ANC not present
    recommended_hex: C
    notes: Change 1st digit to C. Note:if your AS BUILT Is a D, leave it selected
      to keep ANC enabled.
